{
  "contract_version": 1,
  "endpoint": "POST /action",
  "description": "The action/state contract the engine dispatch reads (API.1). Python pins ActionRequest against this file; the Godot client must send exactly these keys. Unknown fields are rejected with 422 (extra=forbid); a missing 'action' is 422; omitted optionals must not be sent at all (the server drops nulls before dispatch).",
